&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Global Returns Associate&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a key role in delivering a world-class customer experience. You will efficiently manage inbound product returns, process orders accurately, and support continuous improvement within our returns operation. Your strong organisational skills, attention to detail, and clear communication will help optimise our workflows and uphold Axon’s reputation for excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day administrative processing of returned Axon products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide accurate, complete, and timely information to customers and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvements to enhance efficiency and customer service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with updating and maintaining Axon databases and relevant systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support additional projects within the Global Returns Team as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other duties that may reasonably be assigned in line with the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to travel across the UK to deliver Axon products to our customers. (This will include overnight stays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1–2 years of administrative experience, ideally with ERP systems such as SAP, D365, or equivalent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, organization, and time-management abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in reverse logistics or returns processing is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work on-site full-time at our Daventry warehouse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and willingness to support continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full clean UK Driving licence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;d9579f95 _005fca58&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary and RSUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive pension plan with matching contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health insurance &amp;amp; cash plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days paid holiday + UK public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity/paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GymPass subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life assurance &amp;amp; income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth support and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits listed herein may vary depending on the nature of your employment and the location where you work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
